' CPD-3203: function name conflicts with a built-in function
'expect: CPD-3203[sin]
sin(x) = x

' Two parameters
'expect: CPD-3203[max]
max(a; b) = a

' With an optional parameter and a $Block body
'expect: CPD-3203[sqrt]
sqrt(x; n = 2) = $Block{r = x^(1/n); r}

' From a macro that builds the definition
#def mkfun$(n$) = n$(x) = 2*x
'expect: CPD-3203[cos]
mkfun$(cos)
